    camp_sub: "Version 2.3.1 is now available: new paid license keys in four plans with a free 3-day trial for new users; a fully rebuilt web console that lands on the home page after sign-in; smart support with AI question answering and human hand-off; and a new points and rewards centre where check-ins and usage time can be exchanged for usage time.",
