    camp_t2p: "When something goes wrong, ask smart support first. Its knowledge base covers connections, remote desktop, files, the terminal, the privacy lock, friends, and the forum, answering common questions right away with steps and shortcuts. Anything it cannot solve can be handed over to a human in the same conversation. It also works while signed out; frozen or banned accounts can verify their identity to check processing and appeal status.",
    camp_t2p1: "Instant answers to common questions, no waiting for a reply",
    camp_t2p2: "Unsolved issues hand over to a human, described only once",
    camp_t2p3: "Works while signed out; check frozen or banned status",
